&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p style="clear:both; line-height:0.75pt; width:100%; font-size:0.75pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:31.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;（注）各利益項目の率は、売上高に対する利益率を表しております。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:31.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:36pt;text-indent:-9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;line-height:18pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;・Phase3期間中の目標&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:27pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
